{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-la-perla","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"la-perla-bnw-developments-al-marjan-island","about":"La Perla by BNW Developments is a boutique waterfront residential project on Al Marjan Island, Ras Al Khaimah, offering an exclusive collection of 57 Spanish-style 1–3 bedroom apartments, duplexes, and penthouses. Developed in collaboration with Pearl Development, the BNW La Perla project draws inspiration from the elegance of a pearl, rare, luminous, and intimately scaled. Set within a 2B+G+6F+R structure, over 60% of the homes feature direct Arabian Gulf views, while open layouts, natural light, and high ceilings create a serene connection to nature.Blending Andalusian-inspired architecture with modern technology and refined finishes, La Perla Al Marjan Island embodies a lifestyle of luxury and tranquility. From flowing balconies and Spanish courtyards to rooftop leisure spaces and sea-facing terraces, every detail celebrates coastal living. With prices starting from AED 2.16M, a 50/50 payment plan, and handover in Q4 2027, La Perla waterfront residences promise not only elegant living but also an ROI potential of 7–8%, making it a standout investment in Ras Al Khaimah’s luxury property market.","price":2160000,"title":"La Perla","bitrix":{"id":1345,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":null,"tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"La Perla","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"BnW Developments","project_location":null},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/La_Perla_by_BNW_Developments_Luxury_Apartments_at_Al_Marjan_Island_RAK_95513d3ae4.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/La_Perla_by_BNW_Developments_Luxury_Apartments_at_Al_Marjan_Island_RAK_95513d3ae4.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":{"lat":25.686417789453,"lng":55.736804070636},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"http